.TH AMERIKA-SETTINGS 1 "2026-10-21" "Amerika OS" "Amerika OS Manual"
.SH NAME
amerika\-settings \- the Amerika OS settings application
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B amerika\-settings
.RB [ \-\-list ]
.RB [ \-\-help ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B amerika\-settings
opens the Amerika Settings window: appearance, displays, sound, network, Bluetooth, power, keyboard shortcuts, the
login and boot screens, and AI and assistants. Changes apply to the current user unless the page says otherwise;
actions that need administrator rights ask through
.BR pkexec (1).
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-list
Print the settings pages and searchable entries as JSON and exit. Needs no display.
.TP
.BR \-h , " \-\-help"
Print a usage message.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/amerika\-os/
Per\-user state (first\-run marker, AI audit log).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR amerika\-shell (1),
.BR amerika\-login (1),
.BR amerika\-boot (1),
.BR amerika\-first\-run (1)
